  "worked_solution": "First, we remove the third row and third column:\n\n$$\nR=[\\begin{aligned}z & -3 & \u2217 \\\\ -5 & z-8 & \u2217 \\\\ \u2217 & \u2217 & 6z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of ${r}_{33}$ is\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}z & -3 \\\\ 5 & z-8\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}z & -3 \\\\ 5 & z-8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =z\\cdot (z-8)-(-3)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & ={z}^{2}-8z+15.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${r}_{33}$ is $3$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}-8z+15 & =3 \\\\ {z}^{2}-8z+12 & =0 \\\\ (z-2)(z-6) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $z=2$ and $z=6.$",
